---
source: crates/safix/src/reporter.rs
expression: render_plain(&refusal)
---
safix: 'api-token' has no generator, so there is nothing to run.

A generator is declared on the entry, beside its mode and its path:

    generator.script = "openssl rand -base64 32";
    generator.runtimeInputs = [ "openssl" ];

Only a value you are free to choose can have one. A credential some
server already knows is set by hand:

    safix set alice api-token
